# 在每个等号后填写您自己的第三方 API 凭据；没有的项目留空，不填写后台鉴权 Token。
# 请保留文件名 .env；Mac Finder 按 Command + Shift + . 显示隐藏文件。
# Copy to .env only when it does not already exist; supply approved credentials.
# Values are parsed as text: no shell execution, variable expansion, or environment injection.
# Syntax: NAME=value, optional matching single/double quotes; comments occupy their own # line.
# Duplicate keys and unmatched quotes are invalid; $ and # inside values remain literal.
# Empty values are unconfigured. Backend token uses config.json/config.local.json or LAOCHEN_BACKEND_TOKEN, never this file.
# New private files use mode 0600 on macOS/Unix; .env requires private permissions.
# Existing backend config permissions retain the original authorization behavior.
# Never commit or distribute the populated files. A configured key does not enable a source.
EPO_OPS_CONSUMER_KEY=
EPO_OPS_CONSUMER_SECRET=
EUIPO_CLIENT_ID=
EUIPO_CLIENT_SECRET=
JPO_API_USERNAME=
JPO_API_PASSWORD=
INPI_USERNAME=
INPI_PASSWORD=
SERPER_API_KEY=
SIGNA_API_KEY=
SERPAPI_API_KEY=
RAPIDAPI_KEY=
